        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Marketplace Director/Finance define commission % by category (e.g., 8–15%), referral fee, fixed fee per listing, optional Fulfilled-by-BuildRight fee (links to VS-93), advertising/promotion fee (links to VS-48), and refund/return fee allocation
