      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Seller request; performance termination (links to W3156); seller bankruptcy; contract expiry
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Per seller
Owner: Marketplace Manager
Participants: Marketplace Mgr, Legal, Finance, IT, Seller Operations, CS (links to VS-13)
Source: workflow W3144 — Seller Offboarding, Exit &amp; Data Portability</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3144_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3144_Lane1" name="Marketplace Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3144_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
